this question in the next section.
Sodium carbonate and sodium hydrogencarbonate are useful
chemicals for many industrial processes as well.
Uses of washing soda
(i)Sodium carbonate (washing soda) is used in glass, soap and
paper industries.
(ii)It is used in the manufacture of sodium compounds such as borax.
(iii)Sodium carbonate can be used as a cleaning agent for domestic
purposes.
(iv)It is used for r emoving per manent har dness of water .', 'The common salt thus obtained is an important raw material for various materials of daily use, such as sodium hydroxide, baking soda, washing soda, bleaching powder and many more. Let us see how one substance is used for making all these different substances.', '2026-09-23 12:20:22.298041+00:00') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
