spatula
Figure 3.8Figure 3.8Figure 3.8Figure 3.8Figure 3.8
Testing the conductivity of
a salt solutionTable 3.4  Melting and boiling points of some ionic compounds
Ionic Melting point Boiling point
compound (K) (K)
